        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Killers Three\n- Companies: Dick Clark Productions, American International Pictures\n- People: Robert Walker Jr., Diane Varsi, Dick Clark, Bonnie Owens, Buck Owens, Merle Haggard\n- Topics: crime drama films, country music\n\nFacts:\n- Killers Three is a crime drama film produced in 1968 by Dick Clark Productions.\n- Killers Three was released by American International Pictures and stars Robert Walker Jr., Diane Varsi, and Dick Clark.\n- Bonnie Owens was born Bonnie Campbell on October 1, 1929.\n- Bonnie Owens was an American country music singer.\n- Bonnie Owens was married to Buck Owens and later to Merle Haggard.\n- Bonnie Owens died on April 24, 2006.",
